      "id": 1,
      "text": "Lo Espejo earned its name from a playful mirror habit of train‑traveling ladies and a mischievous sign‑change that turned “Lo Sierra” into “Lo Espejo.”.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15,
        16,
        17,
